00:27:13.780 --> 00:27:15.880
there's a thing where you're caught in a pickle.

00:27:16.140 --> 00:27:20.160
Basically the base runner is between first and second, let's say.

00:27:20.720 --> 00:27:24.860
And, um, one of the basemen is clearly in possession of the ball.

00:27:24.980 --> 00:27:30.540
