00:27:30.880 --> 00:27:32.240
a rundown, right? Yeah.

00:27:32.420 --> 00:27:37.540
A rundown essentially. This is where they continue to, until they tag you out in real life baseball.

00:27:37.540 --> 00:27:41.640
